Pointer Operations
c&var      // address of var
*ptr      // value at ptr (dereference)
ptr++     // move to next element (address += sizeof(type))
ptr--     // move to previous element
ptr + n   // address of nth element ahead
*(ptr+n)  // value of nth element 
Array-Pointer Equivalence
ca[i]  ==  *(a+i)  ==  i[a]  ==  *(i+a)
Call by Value vs Address
Call by Value:   swap(a, b)    → copies, original unchanged
Call by Address: swap(&a, &b)  → pointers, original changed
